What this license does NOT cover

- Data. The exchange-rate figures read by this software are published by the
  Banco Central de Bolivia and by each bank on its own public website. They
  belong to their publishers, are informational only, and carry no license
  from this project.
- Third-party material. The files in scraper/tests/fixtures/ are saved copies
  of pages and responses from those websites, kept only to test the parsers.
  They remain the property of their respective owners.
